{"id":"n49483-1-15","stage":5,"title":"당사자 · 当事人","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49483-1-15-1","ko":"당신 형이 내 돈을 빌려 갔다고요!","zh":"是你哥哥借走了我的钱！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"당신","meaning":"你","explanation":"당신：你。","readings":[{"term":"당신","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30200","senseId":"3","lemma":"당신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당신","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3"}},{"text":"형이","meaning":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","explanation":"형：哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"1","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형이","audio":"/audio/7eb107b79d357f4a6f75.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈을","audio":"/audio/658b47180707ddf8eb38.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려","audio":"/audio/67cc0fe84cbb6a7195bd.mp3"}},{"text":"갔다고요!","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔다고요","audio":"/audio/6be543554220f759bcff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"348eb0b3d01dfc54","term":"당신","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3","entryId":"30200","definition":"(贬称)指代听话人。","pronunciation":["당신"]},{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/01a5c4ec942493b90f7f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49483-1-15-2","ko":"저는 아무 관계가 없으니 당사자에게 직접 물어보세요.","zh":"和我没关系，请直接问当事人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么。","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}},{"text":"관계가","meaning":"关系","explanation":"관계：关系；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"관계","audio":"/audio/18ab6599abaaab1b0c2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21898","senseId":"1","lemma":"관계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관계가","audio":"/audio/c36f7f210cd28c090b79.mp3"}},{"text":"없으니","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없으니","audio":"/audio/21a60add67d2b43dbcdd.mp3"}},{"text":"당사자에게","meaning":"当事人","explanation":"당사자：当事人；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"당사자","audio":"/audio/963432b6714385f9813d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49483","senseId":"1","lemma":"당사자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당사자에게","audio":"/audio/2cca226dc37cbe85d7fd.mp3"}},{"text":"직접","meaning":"直接","explanation":"직접：直接。","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71497","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}},{"text":"물어보세요.","meaning":"问；试，试图","explanation":"묻다：问；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69471","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물어보세요","audio":"/audio/fe341d31d6fb267565ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definitio